    `${path.basename(source)}  ${before.size} KiB -> ${after.size} KiB  loose ${before.loose} -> ${after.loose}  objects ${before.objects.length} -> ${after.objects.length} ${same ? "identical" : "MISMATCH"}  ${elapsed.toFixed(0)} ms`,
